OL,3,GNEWSAOne of Orkney's busiest post
OL,4,Aoffices shuts 'without warning'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the busiest post offices in
OL,7,FOrkney has been shut until further
OL,8,Fnotice due to staffing issues.
OL,10,FCustomers found a handwritten note
OL,11,Fstuck to the window of Kirkwall's
OL,12,FJunction Road branch on Monday
OL,13,Finforming them of the closure.
OL,15,FBetty Muir, who runs the nearest
OL,16,Falternative branch in the town's
OL,17,FPapdale Stores, said no prior warning
OL,18,Fwas given and her staff had no time to
OL,19,Fprepare for the extra customers.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
