OL,3,GNEWSAOne of Orkney's busiest post
OL,4,Aoffices shuts 'without warning'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Post Office has apologised for the
OL,7,Finconvenience. No date has been
OL,8,Fprovided for the reopening of the
OL,9,FJunction Road branch.
